Input[Destination dates duration budget] --> Validate[Validate supported planning inputs]
Validate --> Owner[Authenticated trip ownership]
Owner --> Save[Persist trip and edits]
Save --> Model[Real generation dependency]
Model --> Suggestions[Suggestions not bookings or live prices]
Provider[External travel adapters unqualified] -. explicit verified provider needed .-> Suggestions
Cancel[Cancellation and unavailable states] --> Model
